2.—(1) In these Rules —
“contact address”, for a person, means any of the following nominated by the person for the receiving of documents under these Rules:
(a)the person’s residential address in Singapore;
(b)the person’s place of business or work in or outside Singapore;
(c)an email address;
“proposal” means a proposal by the Authority —
(a)to issue an online Code of Practice, including issuing any online Code of Practice to replace another online Code of Practice; or
(b)to amend or revoke an online Code of Practice.
(2) Where the time specified by these Rules for doing any act expires on a Saturday, Sunday or public holiday, the act is in time if done on the next following day that is neither a Saturday, Sunday or public holiday.
